         COL 22 'WEEKLY FOLLOWING-UP WARRANTY-REPORTS SUMMARY ' +               
                                                                                
TITLE 2  COL 01 '  CORE PART'           +                                       
         COL 12 '     QUANTITY'        +                                        
                                                                                
