  END-PROC                                                                      
                                                                                
  REPORT LISTA62                +                                               
         PRINTER W3724HD6       +                                               
         PAGESIZE 41            +                                               
         LINESIZE 120           +                                               
         SPACE 1                +                                               
         TITLESKIP 1            +                                               
         NOHEADING              +                                               
         NOSPREAD               +                                               
         NOADJUST               +                                               
         NODATE                                                                 
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
SEQUENCE W-IDDISTR W-IDKUNDNR W-IDBYTRAP W-IDARTNR                              
                                                                                
